  "label": "Pejorative Language",
  "description": "The use of derogatory or dismissive language to undermine the legitimacy or seriousness of a group or individual. In this meme, 'gang' is a pejorative term that contrasts with the formal, collective identity implied by 'squad.' This linguistic strategy is a common tactic in political discourse and media to delegitimize opponents or groups perceived as threatening to the status quo.",
